Package: cointf
Title: Fast Likelihoods for the Housworth-Stahl Model of Crossover Interference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arjun", "Biddanda", email = "aabiddanda@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to the 'cointf' Python package, which computes exact
    log-likelihoods of crossover positions under the two-pathway
    (gamma interference plus Poisson escape) Housworth-Stahl model, for single
    meioses and for phase-unknown (quartet) data, and simulates from the model.
    The Python package is installed automatically through 'reticulate'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/aabiddanda/cointf
BugReports: https://github.com/aabiddanda/cointf/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.41)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
